Package: enemduR
Title: Infrastructure Tools for Reproducible ENEMDU Microdata Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Alejandro",
           family = "Yerovi",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "yerovi84@hotmail.com")
Description: Structured analytical infrastructure for reading, standardizing,
    validating, diagnosing, and progressively deriving indicators from ENEMDU
    microdata. The package is designed to support monthly, quarterly, and annual
    ENEMDU workflows while preserving a strict separation between analytical core
    logic and future presentation helpers for Quarto. It includes metadata-driven
    support for survey representativity scope, complex survey design declaration,
    and precision assessment contracts based on official methodological criteria.
